# The fix moves the whole `| render` line, keeping the layout.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv'
| summarize total = sum(amount) by customerId
| render barchart with (title = "Totals")
| sort by total desc
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..127
  PIPELINE@0..126
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 "\n"
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    SUMMARIZE_OP@20..63
      IDENT@20..29 "summarize"
      WHITESPACE@29..30 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@30..49
        NAME@30..35
          IDENT@30..35 "total"
        WHITESPACE@35..36 " "
        EQ@36..37 "="
        WHITESPACE@37..38 " "
        CALL_EXPR@38..49
          NAME_REF@38..41
            IDENT@38..41 "sum"
          ARG_LIST@41..49
            L_PAREN@41..42 "("
            NAME_REF@42..48
              IDENT@42..48 "amount"
            R_PAREN@48..49 ")"
      WHITESPACE@49..50 " "
      BY_CLAUSE@50..63
        IDENT@50..52 "by"
        WHITESPACE@52..53 " "
        NAMED_EXPR@53..63
          NAME_REF@53..63
            IDENT@53..63 "customerId"
    WHITESPACE@63..64 "\n"
    PIPE@64..65 "|"
    WHITESPACE@65..66 " "
    RENDER_OP@66..105
      IDENT@66..72 "render"
      WHITESPACE@72..73 " "
      IDENT@73..81 "barchart"
      WHITESPACE@81..82 " "
      RENDER_PROPS@82..105
        IDENT@82..86 "with"
        WHITESPACE@86..87 " "
        L_PAREN@87..88 "("
        RENDER_PROP@88..104
          NAME@88..93
            IDENT@88..93 "title"
          WHITESPACE@93..94 " "
          EQ@94..95 "="
          WHITESPACE@95..96 " "
          LITERAL@96..104
            STRING@96..104 "\"Totals\""
        R_PAREN@104..105 ")"
    WHITESPACE@105..106 "\n"
    PIPE@106..107 "|"
    WHITESPACE@107..108 " "
    SORT_OP@108..126
      IDENT@108..112 "sort"
      WHITESPACE@112..113 " "
      IDENT@113..115 "by"
      WHITESPACE@115..116 " "
      SORT_KEY@116..126
        NAME_REF@116..121
          IDENT@116..121 "total"
        WHITESPACE@121..122 " "
        IDENT@122..126 "desc"
  WHITESPACE@126..127 "\n"

error[DS0120]: `render` must be the last operator
  --> query:3:3
  |
3 | | render barchart with (title = "Totals")
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the chart is drawn at this point
4 | | sort by total desc
  |   ------------------ this operator comes after `render`
  |
  = help: move `render barchart with (title = "Totals")` to the end of the query

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv'
    | summarize total = sum(amount) by customerId
    | sort by total desc
    | render barchart with (title = "Totals")
which parses without errors
